WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:14.573
When Dr.

2
00:00:14.613 --> 00:00:18.375
Dolittle was a people doctor, he once helped a sick sailor.

3
00:00:19.075 --> 00:00:21.476
The sailor was very grateful to the doctor.

4
00:00:21.496 --> 00:00:26.298
"I will give you whatever you want," he promised.

5
00:00:26.999 --> 00:00:27.199
So Dr.

6
00:00:27.239 --> 00:00:29.980
Dolittle decided to ask for his help.

7
00:00:30.776 --> 00:00:33.257
"I need to travel to Africa," he said.

8
00:00:33.277 --> 00:00:37.139
"You may use my boat," the sailor answered.

9
00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:40.420
Soon Dr.

10
00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:43.441
Dolittle was ready for the great journey to Africa.

11
00:00:44.242 --> 00:00:47.003
He felt excited and sad at the same time.

12
00:00:47.843 --> 00:00:50.024
He could not take all the animals with him.

13
00:00:50.044 --> 00:00:56.607
"Take care of the house," he said to the remaining animals.

14
00:00:56.627 --> 00:00:59.328
"Stay warm and drink lots of water."

15
00:01:00.624 --> 00:01:02.146
"We'll miss you, Dr.

16
00:01:02.166 --> 00:01:05.008
Dolittle," the animals cried.

17
00:01:08.711 --> 00:01:10.873
For six long weeks, they sailed.

18
00:01:11.574 --> 00:01:15.157
Polynesia and Chee-Chee enjoyed the sun and the ocean.

19
00:01:15.177 --> 00:01:17.479
"Can you see Africa yet?"

20
00:01:17.979 --> 00:01:18.900
the monkey asked.

21
00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:22.463
"Not yet, Chee-Chee, but soon," answered the doctor.

22
00:01:23.244 --> 00:01:27.488
The parrot and the monkey were so excited to return to Africa, their home.

23
00:01:29.344 --> 00:01:32.506
However, the others were not enjoying themselves too much.

24
00:01:32.526 --> 00:01:37.469
"Oh, I feel so sick," the green pig moaned.

25
00:01:37.489 --> 00:01:39.590
"Don't get sick on me!"

26
00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:41.291
growled Jip.

27
00:01:45.193 --> 00:01:51.477
"It's too bad you can't swim," Dab-Dab jumped onto the boat.

28
00:01:51.497 --> 00:01:54.239
"The water is so warm today."

29
00:01:54.259 --> 00:01:56.380
"Hey! Watch it!"

30
00:01:56.928 --> 00:01:59.130
Too-Too did not like water at all.

31
00:02:01.951 --> 00:02:05.554
John Dolittle was a good doctor, but not a good sailor.

32
00:02:05.574 --> 00:02:10.377
"I'm afraid we're lost," he said one morning.

33
00:02:10.397 --> 00:02:13.779
"Yoo-hoo!" "What was that?"

34
00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:15.280
asked Gub-Gub.

35
00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:17.842
"What was what?

36
00:02:18.182 --> 00:02:19.563
I didn't hear anything!"

37
00:02:19.983 --> 00:02:20.724
growled Jip.

38
00:02:21.504 --> 00:02:22.885
"Oh, yoo-hoo!"

39
00:02:22.905 --> 00:02:24.987
"Look! Over there!"

40
00:02:25.747 --> 00:02:26.808
shouted Dab-Dab.

41
00:02:27.516 --> 00:02:29.637
The sound was coming from two dolphins.

42
00:02:29.657 --> 00:02:32.077
"Are you Dr.

43
00:02:32.117 --> 00:02:34.618
Dolittle?" called out one dolphin.

44
00:02:34.638 --> 00:02:36.138
"Yes, I am.

45
00:02:36.498 --> 00:02:37.379
How did you know?"

46
00:02:37.859 --> 00:02:39.999
Dr. Dolittle asked, surprised.

47
00:02:40.019 --> 00:02:42.440
"We heard all about you, Doctor.

48
00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:43.640
You're famous!"

49
00:02:44.361 --> 00:02:45.421
shouted the other one.

50
00:02:45.441 --> 00:02:50.762
"We must get to Africa," said Chee-Chee.

51
00:02:50.782 --> 00:02:52.323
"We know.

52
00:02:52.623 --> 00:02:55.343
We'll help you get there," said the first dolphin.

53
00:02:55.363 --> 00:02:57.184
"Just follow us!"

54
00:02:57.852 --> 00:02:58.573
said the other.

55
00:02:58.593 --> 00:03:02.175
"I bet I could swim faster than them!"

56
00:03:02.936 --> 00:03:04.697
Dab-Dab said with a sniff.

57
00:03:06.358 --> 00:03:07.879
The dolphins guided Dr.

58
00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:09.861
Dolittle's boat across the ocean.

59
00:03:10.882 --> 00:03:15.425
As they passed by, fish and whales swam up to see the animal doctor.

60
00:03:15.445 --> 00:03:18.747
"That's the human who speaks our language!"

61
00:03:19.488 --> 00:03:20.769
whispered a large fish.

62
00:03:20.789 --> 00:03:23.271
"He's going to save the monkeys!"

63
00:03:23.831 --> 00:03:24.712
shouted the whale.

64
00:03:26.688 --> 00:03:29.230
Finally it was time for the dolphins to leave them.

65
00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:33.654
"This is as far as we can go," one dolphin said.

66
00:03:33.674 --> 00:03:39.039
"Just keep going straight and you'll see land," the other said.

67
00:03:39.059 --> 00:03:41.541
"How can we ever thank you?"

68
00:03:42.041 --> 00:03:42.622
asked Dr.

69
00:03:42.662 --> 00:03:45.644
Dolittle. "Save the monkeys, Doctor."

70
00:03:46.485 --> 00:03:49.287
The dolphins swam away into the sunset.

71
00:03:52.230 --> 00:03:54.392
That night, there was a terrible storm.

72
00:03:55.152 --> 00:03:57.854
The waves carried the boat in every direction.

73
00:03:57.874 --> 00:04:03.699
"Oh, I'm going to be sick," Gub-Gub, who was greener than ever, moaned.

74
00:04:03.719 --> 00:04:06.101
"Hold on tight!"

75
00:04:06.622 --> 00:04:07.322
shouted Jip.

76
00:04:09.724 --> 00:04:12.006
The wind howled and the sky roared.

77
00:04:12.026 --> 00:04:15.749
"Are we ever going to make it to Africa?"

78
00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:17.171
cried Chee-Chee.

79
00:04:18.091 --> 00:04:20.453
Suddenly the boat hit something hard.

80
00:04:21.314 --> 00:04:23.256
Water began to fill the boat.

81
00:04:25.072 --> 00:04:25.812
"Jump off!

82
00:04:26.012 --> 00:04:26.893
Jump off!"

83
00:04:27.333 --> 00:04:28.093
shouted Jip.

84
00:04:28.933 --> 00:04:31.254
"Doctor! We're almost on land!"

85
00:04:31.914 --> 00:04:32.854
Too-Too pointed.

86
00:04:32.874 --> 00:04:35.535
"Quick! Dab-Dab!

87
00:04:35.815 --> 00:04:36.655
Take this rope!"

88
00:04:37.316 --> 00:04:38.556
Polynesia commanded.

89
00:04:38.576 --> 00:04:40.737
"Tie it around that tree!"

90
00:04:44.918 --> 00:04:47.358
One by one, the animals and Dr.

91
00:04:47.398 --> 00:04:48.819
Dolittle crossed to land.

92
00:04:49.699 --> 00:04:52.380
They watched as the water swallowed up their boat.

93
00:04:52.992 --> 00:04:57.142
"We don't have a boat anymore," Gub-Gub said sadly.

94
00:04:57.162 --> 00:04:58.785
"But we're alive.

95
00:04:59.146 --> 00:05:01.692
That's the most important thing," Dr.

96
00:05:01.712 --> 00:05:02.634
Dolittle smiled.
